// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BRIEFING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P949693808" "We have minimum resources and we need to make maximum impact."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BRIEFING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1735597578" "Everyone is focused on the Rikti.  Now is the time to make our move."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BRIEFING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3657610490" "This is an opportunity.  Get in while they're distracted by the Rikti.  Make our mark."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BRIEFING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1655239157" "Meeting's over!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BRIEFING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2557609430" "How did you get in here?!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BRIEFING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2989521140" "Take care of it!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2618355579" "We're gonna need a lot more than a few crates to turn this tent into a base."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P929586952" "I'm a highly specialized weapons expert and I'm moving boxes.  There is something seriously wrong with this picture."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2617131350" "One more box and I'm done.  My back is killing me."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2926991381" "You're in the wrong place, pal!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2046911536" "Big mistake!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2804979014" "I don't know how you got in here, but you're going out in a body bag!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_FIXTURRET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P558206196" "Get 'em!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_FIXTURRET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404435140" "You!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_FIXTURRET_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3838643126" "Time to see if this thing works!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P738553489" "Yeah, we're good here."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1778619140" "The guys are itching for some action."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4129019182" "I'm going to send a few guys over soon.  Sounds like you are going to need backup over there."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1918636529" "No.  That's not where I wanted the supplies.  Tell him to move them.  Look, I'm on duty here.  I'll talk to you about it when I get back to base."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2710819121" "Bogeys!  Over and out!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P878140958" "We got company!  Out!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P978401480" "Gotta go!"

// RWZ_LRT_BASEMARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P504120643" "It's almost impossible to keep this base secure.  Too many unsecured areas.  We should have taken over a building."
// RWZ_LRT_BASEMARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1958141737" "It's not just your job if anyone gets through here.  It's your head.  Believe it."
// RWZ_LRT_BASEMARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P87429317" "This way."

// RWZ_LRT_BASEMARCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P249993822" "Stick together!"
// RWZ_LRT_BASEMARCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3668557094" "Take 'em out!"
// RWZ_LRT_BASEMARCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1903147242" "Take 'em down!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_RIFLEMEN_STANDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2758588925" "Shoot anything that moves.  And then shoot it again."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_RIFLEMEN_STANDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P439397316" "I have a weapon in my hand and a twitchy finger.  It's gonna be a good shift."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_RIFLEMEN_STANDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2168526367" "Forget cans on a fence.  I'm gonna find me some Vanguard."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_RIFLEMEN_STANDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3900707542" "Woo!  Moving targets!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_RIFLEMEN_STANDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2083038854" "Time to play!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_RIFLEMEN_STANDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SAPPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1426489772" "It will be my pleasure to suck the life right out of you."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SAPPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2824695940" "Awww...are you feeling tired?  Wait for it."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SAPPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P11937370" "Not quite as spry as you were a moment ago, are you?"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4182154718" "Good shot."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2153123758" "Nice job."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3011104638" "Not quite.  Pretend it's me.  You'll aim better."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1488307815" "Moving targets!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1874471270" "Instruction time's over!  Get to work!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1583233912" "Unauthorized personnel!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3773162330" "Feel free to use maximum force!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TITANPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P605877830" "Target: acquired.  Destruction:  imminent."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2771099679" "I do not want excuses, men.  I will not hear them!  This is not your mama's war."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P851467251" "Did you say something, soldier?  Did you?!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3347828113" "You will listen to me and you will listen good or I will have you on latrine duty for the rest of your natural born life.  Is that CLEAR?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P63354550" "I do not recall signing on for a bunch of little girls when I requested troops for this detail.  Yet here before me they stand.  Are you going to CRY now?"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3684311167" "Take care of this!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3192138420" "Earn your pay!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P306518749" "Oh come ON, my grandmother moves faster than that!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2925658331" "That's the best you got?!  It ain't GOOD ENOUGH!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2491294462" "Move it move it MOVE IT!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DRILLYELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2985988453" "Get 'em."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DRILLYELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P927808057" "Here we go!  Booyeah!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DRILLYELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2557994292" "Let's go, men!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DRILLYELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3868978757" "This is not a drill!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2030669631" "That weapon better be spotless."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3977120948" "Not good enough.  Take it apart."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2981275926" "Again.  This time with your eyes closed."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3626559050" "Do it again."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2546443803" "Lock and load, people!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2532626763" "Just another operation.  I'll take out whoever gets in my way.  Simple as that."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1314378953" "If we play it smart, Vanguard and the aliens will do away with each other in due time.  All we need to do is step in and pick up the pieces.  And take over, of course."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P924456628" "Feel free to use maximum force if you encounter any resistance.  In fact, I was told it's encouraged."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1063579271" "It's gonna heat up real good around here.  Bring on the excitement is all I can say."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4256676260" "Maximum force!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
